Package: aura
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Aura Contributors <charxard1332@icloud.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPS@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Challen1224/Aura
Description: Aura programming language
 A statically-typed, object-oriented programming language and runtime,
 architected like C# / .NET CLR and written entirely in Rust.
 .
 Ships the aura CLI: compile and run .aura programs on a bytecode VM with
 a generational GC and (on x86-64 hosts) a tiered JIT, plus a source-level
 debugger (aura debug) and a DAP adapter (aura dap) for VS Code/nvim-dap.
 Example programs are installed under /usr/share/aura/examples.
